F. event rate vs distinction rate (representation.md's 6e4 kicks/game-second):
   kicks update E,L in place on the law's grid: 0 new bits unless first crossing.
   In the smooth belt (outside resonance cover), distinction bits / kick < 1e-9.
   Inside resonance zones the ratio ~ 1 for the first kick per body, 0 after (Tube saturates).
